      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "KELLY ESTATES are delighted to offer this STUNNING three bedroom, three bathroom family home, that comes to the market in EXCELLENT CONDITION THROUGHOUT.\n\nThe accommodation comprises of a large hall leading to the living room, guest w,c. utility room and the large open plan kitchen come dining area with access to the wonderfully landscaped rear garden, the first floor consists of three bedrooms, one of which is ensuite and the main family bathroom.\n\nAn ideal opportunity for those expanding families looking for a beautiful home easily accessible to all amenities. The large rear garden with a wonderful asset to the property. Suited in a very popular and well located development, in Newcastle Village, with Dublin bus providing an easy commute to Dublin City Centre.\n\nThis wonderful home is within easy access to the N7 and M50 Motorway & surrounding areas, Shopping Centre's such as Citywest Shopping Centre & Liffey Valley Shopping Centre are all close by, this wonderful property hosts an abundance of amenities just at your doorstep!\n\n\nPlease note: All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n\n*For open viewings, please confirm your intention to attend, as last minute changes to times can occur**"
